OL,5,G1200 The Phone In
OL,6,     FCan further devolution work in
OL,7,     FWales? What support has helped you
OL,8,     Fmanage Parkinson's disease? And do
OL,9,     Fyou have a treasured family recipe
OL,10,     Fwhich you will pass on?
OL,11,G1400 Behnaz Akhgar
OL,12,     FTony Hadley looks back on 50 years
OL,13,     Fin music, from Spandau Ballet to
OL,14,     Fhis new single. And consumer
OL,15,     Fexpert Harry Kind answers your
OL,16,     Fquestions ahead of the Christmas
OL,17,     Fshopping season.
OL,18,G1700 Radio Wales Drive
OL,19,     FEverything you need to know as you
OL,20,     Fhead home.
